docs {
  Maintainer: highlights Ps 33,6 under 1Mo 1,1 with a comment. Returns the resulting state { sourceHebRefId, targetStartHebRefId, targetEndHebRefId?, origin, rating?, comment?, updatedAt? }.
  403 for non-maintainers, 404 when TSK has no such link, 400 for a bad rating, a comment over 500 characters or a malformed key.
}

